WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:32.365
In this verse, Lord Krishna says,

2
00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:34.492
When a person realizes

3
00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:37.620
that all beings are equal
 in the eyes of the divine...

4
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:40.874
they gradually merge their mind, intellect,

5
00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.752
and soul with the Supreme...

6
00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:44.961
A feeling of peace

7
00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:47.630
and surrender arises in their heart...

8
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:50.842
This surrender grants divine knowledge,

9
00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:54.679
which eliminates all impurities...

10
00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.936
In this verse, Lord Krishna says...

11
00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:04.689
When a person completely focuses 
their intellect, mind, faith,

12
00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:06.066
and devotion

13
00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.234
on the Supreme...

14
00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.862
all their doubts are destroyed

15
00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:11.654
and they

16
00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:14.574
progress on the path to liberation...

17
00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.533
This path

18
00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:17.118
not only frees one from the attachment

19
00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:19.496
to material nature,

20
00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:22.957
but also from the cycle of birth and death...

21
00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:25.502
This is the complete freedom of the soul...

22
00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.796
This itself is liberation...

23
00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:30.131
The path to supreme knowledge

24
00:01:30.131 --> 00:01:31.382
is found

25
00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:33.510
when one connects their soul with the divine...

26
00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.844
with the divine...

27
00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:37.347
This includes a person's intellect,

28
00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:40.683
which guides them in reasoning
 and decision-making...

29
00:01:40.683 --> 00:01:42.477
in reasoning and decision-making...

30
00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:43.394
their mind,

31
00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:44.479
which controls their emotions

32
00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:46.523
and desires...

33
00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:47.565
their faith,

34
00:01:47.565 --> 00:01:48.525
which stabilizes their beliefs

35
00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:50.568
and concepts,

36
00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:52.695
and finally, their devotion...

37
00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:54.656
which determines the ultimate goal

38
00:01:54.656 --> 00:01:56.825
and purpose of their life...

39
00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:58.243
When all these elements

40
00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:00.995
connect with the divine together,

41
00:02:00.995 --> 00:02:03.790
a person attains liberation...

42
00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.333
Lord Krishna says...

43
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:07.836
True knowledge is like the sun...

44
00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:09.462
Just as sunlight

45
00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.755
dispels darkness

46
00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:13.925
and makes everything clear... Similarly, when

47
00:02:13.925 --> 00:02:16.678
a person's mind, intellect, and soul

48
00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:18.596
connect with the ultimate truth...

49
00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:19.222
ignorance

50
00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:21.516
is completely destroyed...

51
00:02:21.516 --> 00:02:22.600
and one gains

52
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:26.855
the ability to see the reality 
of material nature...

53
00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:29.816
They realize their true nature—

54
00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.777
that they are not merely a mortal body,

55
00:02:32.777 --> 00:02:34.988
but a part of the divine...

56
00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:35.947
This realization

57
00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:39.159
leads one toward the divine...

58
00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:42.954
where there is infinite love and peace...

59
00:02:47.792 --> 00:02:48.459
For success in life,

60
00:02:48.459 --> 00:02:51.629
it's essential

61
00:02:51.629 --> 00:02:54.549
to have complete dedication

62
00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:57.594
to your work...

63
00:02:57.594 --> 00:03:00.430
Your intellect, emotions,

64
00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:03.600
faith, and surrender should focus

65
00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.936
on just one goal...

66
00:03:06.936 --> 00:03:10.356
When your intellect, emotions, faith,

67
00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:13.318
and surrender work together

68
00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:14.110
in complete harmony

69
00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.445
toward achieving

70
00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:19.199
a single goal,

71
00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:21.951
you move toward your goal

72
00:03:21.951 --> 00:03:25.246
without any obstacles...

73
00:03:25.246 --> 00:03:29.334
Let's understand this with an example...

74
00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:31.794
A river's purpose is...

75
00:03:31.794 --> 00:03:33.671
to reach the ocean...

76
00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:37.800
Therefore, the river continues its journey 
with complete dedication...

77
00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:42.013
continues its journey...

78
00:03:42.013 --> 00:03:45.391
finds its path and finally

79
00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:48.478
merges into the ocean...

80
00:03:48.478 --> 00:03:53.733
But if the river doesn't flow properly...

81
00:03:53.733 --> 00:03:56.277
starts wandering here and there,

82
00:03:56.277 --> 00:04:01.032
just as your mind or intellect sometimes

83
00:04:01.032 --> 00:04:03.618
deviate from the goal...

84
00:04:03.618 --> 00:04:06.412
then certainly the river

85
00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:09.374
won't reach the ocean...

86
00:04:09.374 --> 00:04:11.042
But

87
00:04:11.042 --> 00:04:11.918
just as a river

88
00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:16.547
flows in the right direction with
 complete dedication...

89
00:04:16.547 --> 00:04:20.969
and finally merges into the ocean...

90
00:04:20.969 --> 00:04:25.431
Similarly, if your intellect,

91
00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:30.812
mind, faith, and sense of surrender work together

92
00:04:30.812 --> 00:04:34.274
in complete harmony toward achieving

93
00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:36.901
a single goal,

94
00:04:36.901 --> 00:04:41.030
you will certainly achieve your goal...

95
00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.826
whether that success is in spiritual life

96
00:04:44.826 --> 00:04:47.829
or worldly affairs...

97
00:04:47.829 --> 00:04:49.872
When your existence,

98
00:04:49.872 --> 00:04:54.419
all your powers... intellect, mind, faith,

99
00:04:54.419 --> 00:04:57.964
and sense of complete surrender move in harmony

100
00:04:57.964 --> 00:05:01.009
toward achieving the goal,

101
00:05:01.009 --> 00:05:03.761
then surely you attain the happiness

102
00:05:03.761 --> 00:05:06.764
of success in personal life...

103
00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.814
Have you ever thought...

104
00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:19.068
why two families living in the same society,

105
00:05:19.068 --> 00:05:19.986
why

106
00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:24.365
one family is happy and prosperous,

107
00:05:24.365 --> 00:05:30.705
while the other faces struggles and problems...

108
00:05:30.705 --> 00:05:32.623
Is the reason wealth,

109
00:05:32.623 --> 00:05:36.502
resources, or external circumstances...??

110
00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:39.339
No...!!! It depends on the family

111
00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:43.176
decisions you make...

112
00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:45.303
In family decisions...

113
00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:48.264
Intellect plays an important role...

114
00:05:48.264 --> 00:05:51.100
Intellect gives you the ability to make

115
00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.771
appropriate decisions in the family's interest...

116
00:05:54.771 --> 00:05:56.606
But,

117
00:05:56.606 --> 00:05:59.776
is intellect everything...?

118
00:05:59.776 --> 00:06:00.735
No!!

119
00:06:00.735 --> 00:06:02.570
In family decisions,

120
00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:07.241
harmony between your 
intellect along with love, trust,

121
00:06:07.241 --> 00:06:11.954
and surrender is essential...

122
00:06:11.954 --> 00:06:15.124
This harmony determines

123
00:06:15.124 --> 00:06:18.586
how to properly use intellect 
in the family's interest...

124
00:06:18.586 --> 00:06:21.547
how to properly use...

125
00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:24.008
If there is intellect but no love

126
00:06:24.008 --> 00:06:27.637
and trust... no sense of surrender,

127
00:06:27.637 --> 00:06:30.306
then the walls of belonging in the home

128
00:06:30.306 --> 00:06:31.974
begin to crumble...

129
00:06:31.974 --> 00:06:35.603
Conflicts and disagreements begin to arise

130
00:06:35.603 --> 00:06:37.271
in relationships...

131
00:06:37.271 --> 00:06:40.400
Just as to sail a boat,

132
00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.902
harmony between the right direction, wind,

133
00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:46.739
and its rudder is necessary...

134
00:06:46.739 --> 00:06:49.700
Similarly, the happiness and prosperity of a family

135
00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:53.621
depends on the harmony of intellect, love,

136
00:06:53.621 --> 00:06:58.126
trust, and surrender...

137
00:06:58.126 --> 00:07:00.420
Love, trust, and

138
00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:03.756
surrender are the threads...

139
00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:08.010
that keep every family member connected...

140
00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:12.473
These are the invisible powers 
that in difficult times...

141
00:07:12.473 --> 00:07:14.851
give you the courage to stand with each other

142
00:07:14.851 --> 00:07:17.186
courage to stand...

143
00:07:17.186 --> 00:07:23.067
Give the opportunity to celebrate 
every joy together...

144
00:07:27.655 --> 00:07:30.658
In professional life, perhaps

145
00:07:30.658 --> 00:07:32.577
you think

146
00:07:32.577 --> 00:07:35.997
that success depends only on your intelligence

147
00:07:35.997 --> 00:07:39.542
or work efficiency...

148
00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:43.087
But success is achieved

149
00:07:43.087 --> 00:07:48.009
when you have a sense of dedication to your

150
00:07:48.009 --> 00:07:51.471
work with your intellect, 
emotions, trust, and loyalty...

151
00:07:51.471 --> 00:07:54.056
sense of dedication...

152
00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:57.810
This very sense of dedication is the strength

153
00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:02.440
that gives you the ability to make decisions 
with confidence in difficult times

154
00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.151
to make decisions...

155
00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:08.946
and you turn challenges into opportunities...

156
00:08:08.946 --> 00:08:13.159
In your complete dedication to work...

157
00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:18.122
intellect guides you...

158
00:08:18.122 --> 00:08:20.291
creates new

159
00:08:20.291 --> 00:08:21.667
policies for achieving goals

160
00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:25.087
and helps in making appropriate decisions...

161
00:08:25.087 --> 00:08:26.964
If there is no intellect,

162
00:08:26.964 --> 00:08:30.218
work begins to become directionless...

163
00:08:30.218 --> 00:08:33.930
But just as a vehicle needs an engine to run...

164
00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:37.475
it equally needs

165
00:08:37.475 --> 00:08:41.270
fuel... That fuel is

166
00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.023
your emotions.

167
00:08:44.023 --> 00:08:48.069
Like passion, commitment, and desire...

168
00:08:48.069 --> 00:08:49.487
When your mind

169
00:08:49.487 --> 00:08:52.615
is dedicated to your work,

170
00:08:52.615 --> 00:08:55.826
you complete that work with complete concentration and

171
00:08:55.826 --> 00:08:58.579
love...

172
00:08:58.579 --> 00:09:02.291
But in professional work, intellect

173
00:09:02.291 --> 00:09:05.378
and emotions alone are not enough...

174
00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:08.756
Trust is equally important...

175
00:09:08.756 --> 00:09:09.590
This trust

176
00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:13.427
keeps you stable in difficult times...

177
00:09:13.427 --> 00:09:16.180
Believe in yourself, in your abilities,

178
00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.308
and in the path you have chosen...

179
00:09:19.308 --> 00:09:24.230
Believe... And, finally, necessary is

180
00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.317
a sense of dedication to work...

181
00:09:28.317 --> 00:09:32.071
This gives you true loyalty to your work

182
00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:35.950
and the motivation to complete it...

183
00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:39.996
and makes your work the essence of life...

184
00:09:39.996 --> 00:09:43.207
When you work with your intellect, emotions,

185
00:09:43.207 --> 00:09:47.295
trust, and sense of dedication...

186
00:09:47.295 --> 00:09:47.962


187
00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:51.882
then you experience a 
divine power within yourself...

188
00:09:51.882 --> 00:09:55.303
And that makes your professional life

189
00:09:55.303 --> 00:09:59.515
meaningful, stable, and prosperous...

190
00:09:59.515 --> 00:10:04.895
Perhaps you may not see
 the results immediately,

191
00:10:04.895 --> 00:10:06.897
but with time,

192
00:10:06.897 --> 00:10:11.068
doors to new opportunities will
 begin to open for you...

193
00:10:11.068 --> 00:10:16.240
which you might have never imagined...!!!
